{"id":"insect-survival-diagnostic-bundle-INTERVAL-CLEANUP-RISK-index-html","gameId":"insect-survival","target":"web","unityWebDevelopment":false,"department":"development","type":"implementation","designChange":false,"designScope":null,"proposedDesignChanges":[],"designFields":[],"assetProductionLane":false,"presentationPass":null,"graphicsReplacementContract":null,"motionRepairWorkUnit":null,"executionLane":"GAME_PRIMARY","goal":"[DIAGNOSTIC_BUNDLE] 같은 기능 경계의 관련 문제를 한 번에 해결한다.\n1. index.html에서 반복 타이머 1개의 생명주기와 중복 실행 여부를 확인해 필요한 경우 해제 경로를 추가한다.\n각 수정 후 해당 파일의 접근성/모바일 입력/기본 성능·문법 안정성도 함께 확인한다.\n\n[WORK PACKAGE AUTO-EXPANSION]\n1. 직접 관련 오류 처리·예외 경로와 실패 피드백을 보강한다.\n2. 현재 책임 시스템과 인벤토리·진행·전투·상호작용 중 실제 연결된 경로의 상태 일치를 확인하고 발견 문제를 수정한다.\n3. 성공·실패·상태 변화 피드백을 실제 판정 시점과 맞추고 누락된 피드백을 보강한다.","responsibleFiles":["web-games/insect-survival/index.html"],"retainedResponsibleFileLocks":[],"dependencies":[],"priority":"critical","portfolioValueScore":0,"ownerDevelopmentHold":false,"releaseState":"development-confirmed","status":"queued","retries":0,"retryPolicy":"UNLIMITED_CAUSAL_REPAIR","maxRetries":null,"ownerDirective":false,"requiresOwnerDecision":false,"protectedChange":false,"paidResourceRequired":false,"productionMode":"AUTONOMOUS_VIBE","supervisionApproved":false,"supervisionContract":null,"supervisionReview":null,"blocker":null,"evidence":["central-policy:/tmp/vibe2-main/company-learning/platform-release-roadmap.json","vibe2-auto-planner:game-catalog","release-state:development-confirmed","source-root:web-games/insect-survival","owner-resumable-build-up:YES","owner-resumable-build-up-source:catalog-owner-direct","owner-resumable-build-up-perpetual:YES","web-internal-priority:recent-owner-work","web-internal-priority-scope:WEB_ONLY","owner-recent-web-source-revision:9526f7d283e6350db8d59f5666df073259e2090850439daf1f7cd3c47a201f4e","diagnostic:INTERVAL_CLEANUP_RISK","diagnostic-key:INTERVAL_CLEANUP_RISK:index.html","diagnostic-severity:medium","repair-mode:MODEL","work-package-